      "description": "One terse, severity-tagged line with its own history; advisories are a quieter unboxed line.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-cas\"><li class=\"ds-cas-msg caution\"><span class=\"ds-sev caution\">CAUTION</span><p>FR hip 56 °C · +1° in 10 min · 14 min in caution · standing</p></li><li class=\"ds-cas-msg advisory\"><span class=\"ds-sev advisory\">ADVISORY</span><p>Now sitting</p></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-cas{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:8px;padding:0;margin:0} .ds-cas-msg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:108px 1fr;align-items:baseline;gap:11px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle,#1E262E);border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface-2,#161B21)} .ds-cas-msg.caution{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,#FFB224 70%,#2C363F)} .ds-cas-msg p{margin:0;font:400 24px/1.2 'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif} .ds-cas-msg.caution p{color:#FFB224} .ds-cas-msg.advisory{background:none;border-color:transparent;padding-block:2px} .ds-cas-msg.advisory p{font-size:17px;color:#9FB0C0} .ds-sev{justify-self:start;font:700 15px 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:0 5px;border-radius:2px} .ds-sev.caution{background:#FFB224;color:#0B0E12} .ds-sev.advisory{color:var(--accent,#3A9BF0);border:1px solid var(--accent,#3A9BF0)}"
